//              next load's start 0.42 to 0.58, his second coat on a set first (N04); HEAD two-deep 0.92 to 1.00, mean depth 2.2 to 2.5, the
//              second coat in the same wet window.  FILL_ONCE 0 is HEAD byte for byte.  Control paint_fill_once.  opts.coatCover (round 12, P12:
//              the ground's second coat, ground.js GROUND LOADS) is the share of bands a coat 2 lays in place of FILL_COAT_COVER; absent, the fill's.
//   UNEVEN RUNOUT (round 11, P11 step 2.)  A fill's bands run out in different places.  Round ten's fade was one ramp on every band (the film
