//              regular").  Measured on his (Fade_Round11_Receipt step 1): the place along a load where its cover first falls under 0.5 has
//              sd 0.15 to 0.34 across the loads of a window (nine whole tiger strokes: mean 0.51, sd 0.17, range 0.21 to 0.76).  Now each band
//              draws its own knee and end (brushFill lay, on the fill's child stream rng.fork(11)): the knee follows the paint the band starts
//              with (FILL_KNEE x (FILL_KNEE_LO + (1 - LO) x the carried load over a full hold): a band that took the last one's leftover fades
