//   (quota of full-brush bands per pass), under / underAng 0.3 / underCover 0.7 / underBody 0.55 / underW 1.1, angJit, edgeWave, passes.
//   dab: color, r / w (diameter), squash 0.9, angle (axis), lift (world angle the brush left toward), jitter 0.1, alpha 0.95, body, second
