//   Ignored, the surface does their job now: ridge, ridgeLight, ridgeBare, sheen, grain, mottle, streak, streakLines, torn, fray, edge, hair,
//   corner, endBow, drag, dragLen, smear, pull, lanes, hueVar, soft, drip, guide, merge, restroke, drips, split, maxLen, pieceCover, wvJit,
