//                ignores the option (the planted negative).  Control: harness/kit2_k3/control.js.
//       loads    (round 12, P12; lane P12) THE GROUND IS ADJACENT LOADS.  Default on (PK.paint.fieldK.LOADS 1): the field's colour is laid as
//                brushFill bands (brush.js FILL ONCE + UNEVEN RUNOUT) at the ground brush's width, the canvas's long side / fieldK.LOADS_W
