//                caller's stream (the same count), so every mark after the ground stands where it stood.  Control: rules/planted/paint_ground_loads.js
//     Each lane is one gesture (L.tick()).  Returns the lane count (with loads: the bands laid).  Zero-area polygon: returns 0, deposits nothing.
//
// WHO OWNS THE GRAIN.  The lit tooth does.  In Nava's photographs the grain of bare canvas is light on a height field (the weave), and it
