// dirt, not height.  When a paint layer follows, call the 2D ground with tooth 0, weave 0, streak 0 (colour only); this file makes the height.
//
// Calibration (P4, 2026-09-04, box, 480x360 bare cream composited through paintEnd, 240x240 window, ground_good's measures plus a mean row
// periodogram).  Grain alone (fibers 0, mottle 0): sd 0.0038, lag-1 0.73 / 0.62, features 1.9 x 1.4 px; with specks and mottle: sd 0.0047,
