// materials/ground.js : toned paper / raw canvas / flat house-paint field.  ONE call per painting normally.
// Base: G (per-pixel tooth + slow mottle + fibres, records kit.paper).  Folded in:
//   D  woven threads (weave/pitch/warm)            C  'under' canvas with long translucent strokes of the paint over it
//   A  scumble: dry drags of the same paint, lighter and darker, so a flat field is never flat
