//   mottle   0..0.3    slow uneven-coverage amplitude; 0.05 = sd 0.8% over the canvas, most of it wider than 150 px   (0.05)   alias tone
//   cell     px        mottle base wavelength; two more octaves at 2.6x and 6.5x are added   (60)     alias mottleScale
//   warm     0..1      mottle drifts warm (1) or neutral (0)              (0.5)
//   weave    0..0.1    thread tooth (0 = none): APERIODIC, each thread direction fades in and out under its own mask   (0)
//   pitch    px        thread pitch, drifts +-1.5 pitch across the canvas (2.3)
//   fibers   0..1      specks and the odd short fibre per 100x100 (dirt, knots, a hair in the priming)   (0.6)
