//   paint field, roller lanes) and pace_76437.jpg 1450,1880 (canvas under a thin peach wash).  What his has: luminance grain sd 0.3-0.5%
//   with lag-1 autocorrelation 0.4-0.7 (features 1.5-2.5 px, slightly longer along the weft), NO periodic peak, slow mottle sd 0.2-0.4%
//   inside a 240 crop, a dozen dark specks 1-2 px per 240x240, and on house paint the grain runs in fine streaks along the roller.
//   What ours had: white per-pixel noise at sd 3.6% (lag-1 autocorrelation 0.0), mottle sd 2%, and with weave > 0 two separable
