// materials/brush.js : loaded acrylic / oil brush.  brushStroke = one stroke, brushFill = a shape filled with LONG strokes,
// scumblePatch = a small shadow/highlight patch inside an edge scrubbed with short strokes in several directions (the licensed exception; not a fill).
