// ==== src/hand/marks.js
// hand/marks.js : Nava-default wrappers over the kit.  The eleven Rapture copies made the same material choices eleven times;
// these are those choices, once.  Every wrapper is (ctx, rng, path, opts) like the material under it and passes every kit
// option through; it only fills in what the copies always chose.  Widths: `w` is px as in the kit; `wu` is a width in units
// of U = min(canvas w, h) and wins when given (the words in words.js speak in U so a scene renders the same at any frame size).
//   BS  brushStroke  endFade 0 (square torn ends; the bristle-fan default was the "combed hair" fault), dry 0.3, dryProb 0.6;
//                    on a dark colour (lum < 0.3) ridge 0 and sheen 0 (no grey ridge lines on black paint)       (R08, R11)
//   BF  brushFill    fitWidth true (the small-shape rule is a floor), contour 0.4, over 0.3 (in w), endFade 0, dry 0.3, dryProb 0.6,
//                    the same dark rule; shortAlt on when the shape is big enough for it (w >= U/40) unless told otherwise (R11, R05);
//                    thin paint (body 0.6, cross 0.3, an under colour) on a light near-round mass over three brush widths across (K-BRUSH, MERGE2)
//   ST  stick        colour ink '#141413', dbl 0.25 (K-STICK: the retrace is bounded, so 0.4 read as fur), smooth 2, tooth 0.3, press 0.45, alpha 0.95   (R11)
//                    over paint (most of the line off PK.kit.paper) grain x0.6, solid 0.5, tooth x0.7: a waxy line, not chalk (R05)
//   SP  spray        passthrough; grain 0.1 (R08's cans)                                                                     (R08, R09)
//   DB  dab          the loaded round dab (K-SMALL): jitter 0, soft 0.22; heads, eyes, hubs, petals, a mass under U/20 across       (MERGE2)
