    // body 0.6, cross pulls 0.3 and an under colour laid first; without this guard 9 of 14 scenes fail lint.  Dark masses stay body 1 (the dark rule owns
    // them).  The under: a sunk colour, or for a saturated top a hue-shifted one (a sunk under beneath magenta reads grey).  o.body given (or o.cover) = as asked.
