// ==== src/hand/words.js
// hand/words.js : the scene words.  A scene file is its traced paths plus a short run of these; each word carries the decisions
// that the eleven Rapture copies made by hand (which copy each came from is in src/hand/HAND.txt).  Sizes are in U = min(W, H)
