//                                                    [lx, ly, w], splashes (o.splashes [[cx,cy,rx,ry]]), gloss pulls (o.gloss paths, o.glossColour)
//              palm(crown, base, top, o)             trunk stroke + stick edge + five fat drooping fronds; crown {cx, cy, L}, o.trunk, o.frond
