// ==== src/hand/figure.js
// hand/figure.js : the figure word (lane H1, round four).  Eight painters each invented skin, a shadow side, hands, feet and a face
// in their own words_local.js and the reviewer read the same faults eight times (a boxy doll, a cream slab, chalk-flat skin, glued
// armpits, weightless hips, mitten hands, a stiff mask).  What the second sittings converged on by hand (W02 S01..S18, W06 R10..R29,
// W08 R01..R18, W05 s01..s20) is one recipe: an opaque warm skin base laid along each limb, a thin darker glaze on the side away from
// the light, a paler pulled stroke on the light side, a placed dark at every joint, hands as a mitt plus stick fingers, feet as a
// stroke plus a sole line, a face of exactly five marks, a Nara line round the whole silhouette.  This file is that recipe, once.
