//   runs through that box along its own direction, from one width outside to one width outside, offset across by up to 0.35 of the box's
//   extent, with a slight bow (up to 0.15 w) and one bend, so no two pulls are parallel rules.  A drawFn that logs no mark returns
//   { pulls: [], drawn: null } and wipes nothing.
//   STREAMS (HAND.txt): the word gets stream r; the pulls' geometry and each PK.wipe's fork come from r in a fixed order; drawFn's own words
//   take their own streams from the scene (h.k counts on), so the return's line has its own tremor, as a second drawing does.
